class_name SidePlans
extends RefCounted
## Floor plans of the side-view gang segments (M5): four per biome, each also mirrored (eight), as
## ASCII like the room plans. Row 0 is the ceiling, row 10 the bottom; a column without ground in
## the bottom row is a pit. SideLayout parses and checks them (tests/unit/test_side_layout.gd and
## tools: scratchpad generator rules = SideLayout.check()).
##
## Legend:
##   #  rock (solid, rock_blob terrain)          =  ledge (one-way platform, front_* tiles)
##   H  ladder (top cell = a one-way step)       .  air
##   S  start (player feet on the cell bottom)   D  exit door
##   o  coin (run gold ×1.5)                     $  golden coin (1 soul crystal), the hardest spot
##   s  slime (hops)                             k  skeleton (walks)
##   ^  spike trap on the floor                  C  chest in a niche (optional)
##   t  wall torch
## Rules every plan follows (SideLayout.check): 40-60 columns, 11 rows, 8-14 platforms, 1-2 pits,
## a ladder or a change of level, 6-12 coins, one golden coin, 1-3 enemies, one spike trap, at most
## one chest; start and door reachable with a 2.5-tile jump, no dead end, every item in reach.

